{"id":"m2://rec/open_logic/content/normal-modal-logic/axioms-systems/more-proofs-in-K.tex#proof-3#1","source":"open_logic","snapshot":"blake3:a5eb116529d3e799289dd9f7e7530d0d446b3615f5608fe08c668241eee3c765","locator":"https://github.com/OpenLogicProject/OpenLogic/blob/1e960beff9ed7835bf3e3f1335e21af3439cd107/content/normal-modal-logic/axioms-systems/more-proofs-in-K.tex#L54","native_id":"content/normal-modal-logic/axioms-systems/more-proofs-in-K.tex#proof-3","kind":"proof","text":"\\begin{derivation}\n    1. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\lnot(!A \\lor !B) \\lif \\lnot!A$ & \\Taut \\\\\n    2. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\Box\\lnot(!A \\lor !B) \\lif \\Box\\lnot!A$ & \\RK, 1 \\\\\n    3. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\lnot\\Box\\lnot !A \\lif \\lnot\\Box\\lnot(!A \\lor!B)$ &\n    \\PL, 2\\\\\n    4. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\Diamond!A \\lif \\Diamond(!A \\lor !B)$ &\n    $\\Diamond$ for $\\lnot\\Box\\lnot$\\\\\n    5. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves \\Diamond!B \\lif \\Diamond(!A \\lor !B)$ & similarly\\\\\n    6. & $\\Log{K} \\Proves (\\Diamond!A \\lor\\Diamond!B) \\lif \\Diamond(!A \\lor !B)$\n    & \\PL, 4, 5.\n  \\end{derivation}","class":"open","by":"textbook/1","resource":"PKGMM3P5QY","at":{"section":"50.6","kind":"proof"}}
